            "description": "The whole scope of effort under one contract or one authorization, measured as a single performance whole. Questions asking how the effort as a whole is performing, how much of the authorized money remains, what the total forecast at completion is, or where the effort stands against its time-phased plan target this class. It is the widest finance subject: an answer scoped to it rolls up everything reported beneath it.",
